1
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,000
"Bittersweet Love"

2
00:01:35,333 --> 00:01:36,333
Where are you going?

3
00:01:37,375 --> 00:01:39,015
I'm gonna take you to see quite the show.

4
00:01:53,038 --> 00:01:54,598
(Episode 12)

5
00:01:56,131 --> 00:01:58,411
The Year 1990.

6
00:01:59,250 --> 00:02:00,410
It really was because of him?

7
00:02:00,583 --> 00:02:01,375
No kidding.

8
00:02:01,541 --> 00:02:02,708
I was in the office that day.

9
00:02:02,958 --> 00:02:04,708
I saw his dad kneel begging the director.

10
00:02:04,916 --> 00:02:05,916
Didn't work.

11
00:02:06,041 --> 00:02:07,291
What he did crossed the line.

12
00:02:07,625 --> 00:02:09,666
Lu Xiaofan never even messed with him.

13
00:02:09,958 --> 00:02:11,438
Still, expelling him's way too harsh.

14
00:02:47,083 --> 00:02:48,883
Don't let me see your
face around here again.

15
00:02:48,916 --> 00:02:52,416
All the stallholders here
owe me fees, no exceptions.

16
00:02:53,291 --> 00:02:55,226
Think you're hot stuff just
'cause you're in college?

17
00:02:55,250 --> 00:02:57,000
And you got expelled.

18
00:02:59,958 --> 00:03:00,958
Let's go.

19
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:25,500
Thanks.

20
00:03:31,166 --> 00:03:32,333
I don't need your pity.

21
00:03:34,291 --> 00:03:35,291
Shen Zhiqin.

22
00:03:35,625 --> 00:03:37,666
I didn't tell my brother to hit you.

23
00:03:40,083 --> 00:03:41,403
I never thought it'd go this far.

24
00:03:41,625 --> 00:03:42,625
Get lost.

25
00:03:43,369 --> 00:03:45,003
["Economic Outlooks"]

26
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:53,500
Shen Zhiqin.

27
00:03:58,666 --> 00:03:59,666
Shen Zhiqin.

28
00:04:02,375 --> 00:04:04,166
At least take the magazines back.

29
00:04:10,166 --> 00:04:12,208
You're Zhiqin's classmate?

30
00:04:13,166 --> 00:04:14,166
Mm-hmm.

31
00:04:14,333 --> 00:04:14,958
Come in.
Come in.

32
00:04:15,916 --> 00:04:16,916
Hello, sir.

33
00:04:21,291 --> 00:04:22,375
Put that down and get out.

34
00:04:24,083 --> 00:04:25,083
Zhiqin...

35
00:04:25,166 --> 00:04:26,791
You're always so hot-headed.

36
00:04:27,041 --> 00:04:29,458
When will you ever learn?

37
00:04:29,666 --> 00:04:30,958
Don't stoop to his level.

38
00:04:33,208 --> 00:04:36,125
You're the first classmate to visit Zhiqin.

39
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:38,208
You're a good kid for that.

40
00:04:39,333 --> 00:04:40,458
What's your name?

41
00:04:43,708 --> 00:04:45,000
Now you're ashamed of yourself?

42
00:04:45,625 --> 00:04:47,500
You didn't care about shame

43
00:04:47,791 --> 00:04:49,191
when you fought and bullied others?

44
00:04:50,541 --> 00:04:51,333
Sir.

45
00:04:51,541 --> 00:04:52,583
My name is Lu Xiaofan.

46
00:04:54,750 --> 00:04:55,750
Back in the day, Zhiqin

47
00:04:55,791 --> 00:04:57,416
always had excellent grades.

48
00:04:58,041 --> 00:04:59,000
I don't know why

49
00:04:59,001 --> 00:05:00,875
he failed the college entrance exam.

50
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:03,900
Back when colleges were
expanding junior-college enrollment.

51
00:05:04,041 --> 00:05:05,041
That year,

52
00:05:05,333 --> 00:05:07,583
I got my leg crushed by a truck.

53
00:05:08,583 --> 00:05:11,832
The payout was just enough for his tuition.

54
00:05:11,833 --> 00:05:13,208
And you know college

55
00:05:13,375 --> 00:05:14,541
is full of rich kids.

56
00:05:15,333 --> 00:05:16,083
Zhiqin

57
00:05:16,084 --> 00:05:17,166
is prideful,

58
00:05:17,375 --> 00:05:19,416
always needs nice clothes.

59
00:05:20,166 --> 00:05:23,208
He had no money, so he sold
magazines for work.

60
00:05:27,916 --> 00:05:28,916
Xiaofan.

61
00:05:30,041 --> 00:05:31,791
Do not stoop to Zhiqin's level.

62
00:05:32,333 --> 00:05:33,708
He just hates looking bad.

63
00:05:35,041 --> 00:05:36,041
Zhiqin...

64
00:05:36,208 --> 00:05:37,208
He is not a bad person.

65
00:05:37,875 --> 00:05:38,999
I hope you

66
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,375
can come visit Zhiqin more often.

67
00:05:41,875 --> 00:05:42,583
I will.
Uncle.

68
00:05:49,458 --> 00:05:50,083
Uncle.
Xiaofan.

69
00:05:50,833 --> 00:05:51,791
You've misunderstood me.

70
00:05:51,792 --> 00:05:53,232
I couldn't possibly take your money.

71
00:05:55,875 --> 00:05:56,958
Who asked for your charity?

72
00:05:57,458 --> 00:05:59,500
I'm just paying for the magazines.

73
00:06:20,916 --> 00:06:22,208
I don't need your pity.

74
00:06:33,208 --> 00:06:34,208
Xiaofan.

75
00:06:35,791 --> 00:06:36,583
So?

76
00:06:36,625 --> 00:06:38,583
Did I stand up for you okay?

77
00:06:39,041 --> 00:06:41,250
Lüqing was never this flashy
during his time at school.

78
00:06:43,416 --> 00:06:44,416
Lu Xiaofan.

79
00:06:44,708 --> 00:06:46,957
Can you stop dragging junk in the building?

80
00:06:46,958 --> 00:06:47,958
Xiaofan.

81
00:06:48,083 --> 00:06:49,763
There is another cardboard box over there.

82
00:06:50,708 --> 00:06:52,500
During those years at school,

83
00:06:52,708 --> 00:06:54,833
Lu Xiaofan was always
scraping together money.

84
00:06:55,708 --> 00:06:56,708
But he knew

85
00:06:56,958 --> 00:06:58,875
this help was just a drop in the bucket

86
00:06:59,083 --> 00:07:00,583
for Shen Zhiqin.

87
00:07:01,291 --> 00:07:03,916
All he could do was keep
Shen Zhiqin's father company,

88
00:07:04,125 --> 00:07:06,708
even if they only talked.

89
00:07:10,250 --> 00:07:11,690
Lu Xiaofan, are you ever gonna stop?

90
00:07:11,916 --> 00:07:13,166
Can't you just buzz off?

91
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:15,500
Oh, Zhiqin.

92
00:07:15,583 --> 00:07:16,583
You're the one who won't stop.
Dad.

93
00:07:17,167 --> 00:07:18,666
He's just here to gloat.

94
00:07:20,208 --> 00:07:21,625
You've already won, Lu Xiaofan.

95
00:07:22,333 --> 00:07:23,457
We're not from the same world.

96
00:07:23,458 --> 00:07:24,458
I know.

97
00:07:24,583 --> 00:07:26,223
You don't need to humiliate me like this.

98
00:07:26,958 --> 00:07:27,958
Sit down.

99
00:07:28,125 --> 00:07:29,958
Xiaofan has had such a tough life.

100
00:07:33,458 --> 00:07:36,125
Lu Xiaofan is one of
those people in this world.

101
00:07:36,958 --> 00:07:38,333
The point of their existence

102
00:07:39,125 --> 00:07:40,666
is not purpose,

103
00:07:41,041 --> 00:07:42,333
nor grand meaning,

104
00:07:43,583 --> 00:07:44,875
but simply to be alive.

105
00:07:44,916 --> 00:07:45,916
So

106
00:07:46,750 --> 00:07:47,833
who knows, I may wind up

107
00:07:48,458 --> 00:07:51,000
back in my mountain village.

108
00:07:54,708 --> 00:07:56,000
Don't you hate Bei Lüqing?

109
00:07:56,291 --> 00:07:57,491
Don't you hate the Bei family?

110
00:08:08,791 --> 00:08:11,500
The first priority is to survive,

111
00:08:12,875 --> 00:08:15,958
afterwards one can
strive to live a good life.

112
00:08:25,166 --> 00:08:26,886
So tell me, how is one supposed to survive,

113
00:08:27,208 --> 00:08:28,288
and then build a good life?

114
00:08:55,958 --> 00:08:56,958
Zhiqin.

115
00:09:17,583 --> 00:09:18,583
Zhiqin.

116
00:09:22,708 --> 00:09:24,541
I know you've been
slipping the old man money

117
00:09:24,708 --> 00:09:25,708
for his medicine.

118
00:09:28,333 --> 00:09:29,653
But it's not your responsibility.

119
00:09:36,958 --> 00:09:38,291
I didn't know it was bone cancer.

120
00:09:38,875 --> 00:09:39,958
You never told me.

121
00:09:42,958 --> 00:09:43,958
What if

122
00:09:44,541 --> 00:09:46,041
there's another way?

123
00:09:52,208 --> 00:09:53,208
Zhiqin.

124
00:09:54,541 --> 00:09:55,833
What are your plans now?

125
00:09:58,791 --> 00:09:59,791
You were right.

126
00:10:01,125 --> 00:10:02,583
China's future lies in its economy.

127
00:10:03,375 --> 00:10:04,375
I believe you.

128
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,000
So I plan

129
00:10:07,166 --> 00:10:08,625
to sell this ancestral home

130
00:10:08,875 --> 00:10:09,875
and go make my mark.

131
00:10:10,083 --> 00:10:12,041
This house is all you've got left.

132
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:13,791
And you're going to sell it?

133
00:10:14,958 --> 00:10:16,500
I will make something of myself.

134
00:10:18,708 --> 00:10:19,708
What I want,

135
00:10:21,458 --> 00:10:23,166
I have to earn myself.

136
00:10:31,041 --> 00:10:32,583
Xiaofan, come on in, take a seat.

137
00:10:38,541 --> 00:10:40,166
This guy doesn't even have an account.

138
00:10:40,375 --> 00:10:42,375
Why read stock papers all day long?

139
00:10:53,288 --> 00:10:55,021
"Securities"

140
00:11:02,875 --> 00:11:03,666
Hello?

141
00:11:03,791 --> 00:11:05,375
Xiaofan, it's me.

142
00:11:06,125 --> 00:11:06,916
Got a minute?

143
00:11:06,917 --> 00:11:07,958
Yeah, yeah, of course.

144
00:11:10,083 --> 00:11:11,083
Lost again?

145
00:11:11,416 --> 00:11:12,625
No losses this time.

146
00:11:13,458 --> 00:11:15,041
It's still climbing.

147
00:11:15,833 --> 00:11:17,291
I don't know whether to sell.

148
00:11:18,750 --> 00:11:21,916
You didn't pour all your cash into it, did you?

149
00:11:22,375 --> 00:11:23,375
Mm-hmm.

150
00:11:24,041 --> 00:11:26,083
Maybe I'll sell some to cover rent.

151
00:11:27,548 --> 00:11:30,339
Rice is due for a rally.

152
00:11:31,125 --> 00:11:32,291
Rice is going up?

153
00:11:32,666 --> 00:11:34,625
Wheat will probably follow suit.

154
00:11:36,958 --> 00:11:39,416
I've seen that in the papers lately too.

155
00:11:40,333 --> 00:11:43,333
I think it still has room to rise.

156
00:11:44,208 --> 00:11:45,208
Stick with it.

157
00:11:46,833 --> 00:11:47,666
Your address hasn't changed, right?

158
00:11:47,667 --> 00:11:48,833
I'll mail you an IOU.

159
00:11:50,166 --> 00:11:50,958
That's really not necessary.

160
00:11:51,083 --> 00:11:52,125
Keep the IOU safe.

161
00:11:52,250 --> 00:11:53,875
I will definitely pay you back.

162
00:12:10,166 --> 00:12:11,166
You finally showed up.

163
00:12:11,375 --> 00:12:12,375
Hey.

164
00:12:12,458 --> 00:12:13,458
Xiaofan.

165
00:12:14,083 --> 00:12:16,832
This is your fiancé Bei Lüqing's

166
00:12:16,833 --> 00:12:17,833
brother-in-law.

167
00:12:20,541 --> 00:12:21,541
Hello.

168
00:12:21,791 --> 00:12:23,000
I'm Bei Lüqing's

169
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:24,750
brother-in-law.

170
00:12:26,333 --> 00:12:27,625
Over the years,

171
00:12:27,875 --> 00:12:30,041
Shen Zhiqin's career has blossomed.

172
00:12:31,125 --> 00:12:32,916
After Xiaofan moved to Lingang,

173
00:12:33,083 --> 00:12:34,392
he thrived in the securities market

174
00:12:34,416 --> 00:12:36,666
behind Bei Lüqing's back.

175
00:12:38,791 --> 00:12:39,541
What's going on?
Had to be in person?

176
00:12:44,083 --> 00:12:45,250
Lovers' quarrel?

177
00:12:47,083 --> 00:12:48,415
If Bei Lüqing finds out
you've been seeing me...

178
00:12:48,416 --> 00:12:49,416
Li Wenxi...

179
00:12:50,333 --> 00:12:52,458
Did he go to your firm today?

180
00:12:57,333 --> 00:12:58,708
Li Wenxi is teaming up with Lu Tao

181
00:12:59,250 --> 00:13:00,690
to take over Bei Lüqing's interests.

182
00:13:04,458 --> 00:13:06,125
You'd spill this to me that easily?

183
00:13:09,916 --> 00:13:11,708
They only floated the idea today.

184
00:13:13,458 --> 00:13:14,833
I would've told you anyway.

185
00:13:15,791 --> 00:13:17,250
I know what I owe you, Lu Xiaofan.

186
00:13:24,291 --> 00:13:25,571
Maybe I shouldn't have told you.

187
00:13:27,416 --> 00:13:29,041
I figured you must hate Bei Lüqing.

188
00:13:29,875 --> 00:13:32,041
Now that I've told
you, this'll weigh on you.

189
00:13:38,041 --> 00:13:39,250
The choice is yours.

190
00:13:40,291 --> 00:13:41,291
If you hate that man,
keep quiet about it.

191
00:13:43,083 --> 00:13:43,875
If you don't hate him,

192
00:13:43,876 --> 00:13:45,396
go tell him Li Wenxi's out to get him.

193
00:13:46,875 --> 00:13:47,875
I don't hate him.

194
00:13:51,833 --> 00:13:52,833
But I

195
00:13:54,166 --> 00:13:56,000
really wish I could hate him.

196
00:13:57,250 --> 00:13:59,000
I even wish he hated me too.

197
00:14:00,625 --> 00:14:01,833
Then don't tell him.

198
00:14:03,166 --> 00:14:04,166
But...

199
00:14:04,583 --> 00:14:06,333
Li Wenxi can't take down my brother,

200
00:14:08,250 --> 00:14:09,666
even with Lu Tao on his side.

201
00:14:11,791 --> 00:14:13,875
Don't put Bei Lüqing on a pedestal.

202
00:14:14,666 --> 00:14:15,749
Li Wenxi has capital,

203
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:16,750
and he plays dirty.

204
00:14:17,208 --> 00:14:18,875
Why can't he take down Bei Lüqing?

205
00:14:20,208 --> 00:14:22,125
Just wait till Bei Lüqing is broke.

206
00:14:23,083 --> 00:14:24,666
Last time Lu Tao and I talked,

207
00:14:25,083 --> 00:14:26,443
he brought up a possible scenario.

208
00:14:27,333 --> 00:14:29,000
That is, if they can figure out

209
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:36,623
his futures contracts, lots and the
price levels where he's building positions,

210
00:14:37,583 --> 00:14:38,875
they could wipe him out

211
00:14:39,041 --> 00:14:40,249
with limited capital

212
00:14:40,250 --> 00:14:41,500
in a short window

213
00:14:42,041 --> 00:14:43,761
and trigger a full margin call all at once.

214
00:14:44,583 --> 00:14:45,583
Okay.

215
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,458
It's not just a possibility.

216
00:14:48,833 --> 00:14:50,583
He's planned this all along, right?

217
00:14:51,625 --> 00:14:53,916
He wants to watch my brother crash hard

218
00:14:54,416 --> 00:14:55,458
and lose everything.

219
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,480
Give him a taste of his own medicine.

220
00:15:01,916 --> 00:15:03,500
What does this have to do with me?

221
00:15:04,875 --> 00:15:07,250
Futures are just big fish
eating small fish nonstop.

222
00:15:07,625 --> 00:15:09,375
Anyone in this market is nothing but fish.

223
00:15:10,083 --> 00:15:12,017
As luck would have it, Bei
Lüqing's one very fat fish.

224
00:15:12,041 --> 00:15:13,761
No surprise Lu Tao's set his sights on him.

225
00:15:15,375 --> 00:15:18,333
If Lu Tao gets exact intel

226
00:15:18,916 --> 00:15:23,957
on his futures contracts, lots
and topping-up price levels,

227
00:15:26,375 --> 00:15:28,791
can you two wipe him out in one go?

228
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:32,500
Are you serious?

229
00:15:35,083 --> 00:15:36,500
Is my brother still trading?

230
00:15:40,333 --> 00:15:41,500
You mean Lu Xiaoping?

231
00:15:42,541 --> 00:15:44,830
It seems Bei Lüqing isn't letting
him get up to speed merely

232
00:15:44,854 --> 00:15:48,020
out of consideration for
your brother's reputation.

233
00:15:49,500 --> 00:15:51,220
He just wants your brother to keep trading.

234
00:15:52,416 --> 00:15:53,896
The young master's got money to burn.

235
00:15:54,458 --> 00:15:55,833
Dropping over ten grand a month

236
00:15:55,875 --> 00:15:57,500
just to watch your brother strut around

237
00:15:57,625 --> 00:15:59,145
and it's well worth the entertainment.

238
00:16:04,791 --> 00:16:06,500
Lüqing's not that shallow.

239
00:16:07,250 --> 00:16:08,832
He's never trusted Li Wenxi.

240
00:16:08,833 --> 00:16:10,000
You're too much.

241
00:16:18,375 --> 00:16:20,750
So Lüqing and Wenxi go way back, huh?

242
00:16:22,291 --> 00:16:23,375
We grew up together.

243
00:16:25,041 --> 00:16:26,601
No wonder they're in business together.

244
00:16:29,125 --> 00:16:30,416
It's all for you, you know.

245
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,000
Careful.

246
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,000
What's wrong?

247
00:16:52,791 --> 00:16:53,791
Nothing.

248
00:16:54,041 --> 00:16:54,791
Let's head in first.

249
00:16:54,958 --> 00:16:55,958
Okay.

250
00:16:58,541 --> 00:17:00,125
If Xiaofan finds out,

251
00:17:00,708 --> 00:17:02,291
you gotta explain it to him.

252
00:17:05,583 --> 00:17:07,625
Li Wenxi met with Lu Xiaofan today.

253
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:09,916
So what does Li Wenxi know?

254
00:17:12,916 --> 00:17:14,236
He probably hasn't found out yet.

255
00:17:14,666 --> 00:17:16,586
But I can't bring myself
to tell Xiaofan either.

256
00:17:16,833 --> 00:17:18,833
I fear Wenxi'll dig something out of him.

257
00:17:20,458 --> 00:17:21,458
Then...

258
00:17:22,666 --> 00:17:24,625
He'd be so heartbroken.

259
00:17:24,958 --> 00:17:26,666
Why does it have to be Song Qianyu?

260
00:17:26,916 --> 00:17:27,750
Couldn't it be anyone else?

261
00:17:27,751 --> 00:17:29,231
Does it have to be Li Wenxi's friend?

262
00:17:29,916 --> 00:17:32,166
This's just twisting the knife in Xiaofan.

263
00:17:33,625 --> 00:17:35,083
Li Wenxi is too clever for that.

264
00:17:35,375 --> 00:17:36,458
If it's not his friend,

265
00:17:37,083 --> 00:17:39,041
he won't trust a word of it.

266
00:17:41,166 --> 00:17:42,625
After all of this is over,

267
00:17:44,250 --> 00:17:45,583
I'll tell Xiaofan then.

268
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,000
I believe in him.

269
00:17:58,500 --> 00:17:59,500
Xiaofan.

270
00:17:59,750 --> 00:18:01,208
I might need to go back to Yunjing.

271
00:18:01,791 --> 00:18:03,250
I'll come back after the New Year.

272
00:18:04,041 --> 00:18:05,041
Uncle.

273
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:06,900
I still have to go back to Lingang.

274
00:18:07,125 --> 00:18:08,250
So I'll take my leave now.

275
00:18:08,500 --> 00:18:10,416
Do you have urgent
business back in Lingang?

276
00:18:11,208 --> 00:18:13,041
If Bei Lüxin doesn't want a divorce...

277
00:18:14,791 --> 00:18:15,791
What will you do?

278
00:18:16,750 --> 00:18:17,916
What can I do then?

279
00:18:19,125 --> 00:18:20,833
Then don't bring up divorce.

280
00:18:35,951 --> 00:18:38,326
After Mr. Bei moved to Lingang,

281
00:18:38,916 --> 00:18:40,707
you're also in charge
of cleaning his place.

282
00:18:40,708 --> 00:18:43,207
Like where things are kept in the house.

283
00:18:43,208 --> 00:18:44,888
You never put anything in the wrong place.

284
00:18:46,416 --> 00:18:48,041
Our housekeeper has great manners.

285
00:18:48,875 --> 00:18:50,395
She never meddles with our belongings.

286
00:18:51,375 --> 00:18:53,875
Everything stays right where she puts it.

287
00:18:55,125 --> 00:18:56,445
But my brother isn't that stupid.

288
00:18:57,166 --> 00:18:59,541
You gotta use Wenxi as bait first.

289
00:19:01,250 --> 00:19:03,109
Lüqing's the smartest. Alright?

290
00:19:03,375 --> 00:19:04,125
Can you stop going on and on...

291
00:19:04,126 --> 00:19:05,500
I trust Xiaofan's judgment.

292
00:19:06,291 --> 00:19:07,291
Look,

293
00:19:08,208 --> 00:19:09,916
the tiny camera's right in here.

294
00:19:11,208 --> 00:19:12,208
But are you sure

295
00:19:13,625 --> 00:19:15,125
we'll pick up the signal for sure?

296
00:19:19,208 --> 00:19:21,208
As for the plan Bei Lüqing
and the rest agreed on,

297
00:19:21,416 --> 00:19:23,541
only the final version
would be the right one.

298
00:19:24,458 --> 00:19:26,333
If you can't guarantee it

299
00:19:26,708 --> 00:19:28,750
stays where Bei Lüqing sits,

300
00:19:29,625 --> 00:19:31,166
we won't see a thing.

301
00:19:35,083 --> 00:19:36,083
Here's the deal.

302
00:19:36,166 --> 00:19:37,374
Once you're abroad,

303
00:19:37,375 --> 00:19:38,541
send me your account details.

304
00:19:39,208 --> 00:19:40,208
Once this is done,

305
00:19:40,333 --> 00:19:42,750
I'll transfer your
commission for this deal.

306
00:19:43,208 --> 00:19:44,500
I'm sure

307
00:19:44,791 --> 00:19:46,666
you'll live a cushy life abroad.

308
00:19:50,791 --> 00:19:51,791
No need.

309
00:19:53,958 --> 00:19:54,958
Zhiqin.

310
00:19:55,750 --> 00:19:57,333
Close out all my positions.

311
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:59,333
I want to withdraw all the money.

312
00:20:00,708 --> 00:20:02,268
You really want to close all positions?

313
00:20:03,166 --> 00:20:05,000
This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

314
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,000
The millions you earned from corn

315
00:20:07,001 --> 00:20:08,583
could roll into tens of millions.

316
00:20:12,750 --> 00:20:13,833
One more thing.

317
00:20:16,041 --> 00:20:17,041
Once you pull this off,

318
00:20:17,916 --> 00:20:19,332
find a way to get out of here fast.

319
00:20:19,333 --> 00:20:20,833
You're overthinking this.

320
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:23,260
Do you really think
they hold all the power?

321
00:20:24,333 --> 00:20:27,927
Besides, the Songnan Gang and the Yunjing
crowd are locked in a fierce battle.

322
00:20:28,208 --> 00:20:29,625
We've got backing.

323
00:20:30,041 --> 00:20:31,332
Taking down Bei Lüqing first.

324
00:20:31,333 --> 00:20:33,013
Just a show of respect for the higher-ups.

325
00:20:33,833 --> 00:20:35,750
Even if CSRC oversees futures,

326
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,958
Bei Lüqing's dad doesn't hold all the sway.

327
00:20:39,083 --> 00:20:40,083
Mr. Lu.

328
00:20:40,625 --> 00:20:41,625
Promise me.

329
00:20:42,583 --> 00:20:43,666
After this job,

330
00:20:44,041 --> 00:20:45,708
you'll take Zhiqin and leave the north.

331
00:20:48,333 --> 00:20:49,333
Otherwise,

332
00:20:51,208 --> 00:20:52,208
I'll walk away.

333
00:20:56,791 --> 00:20:57,791
Okay.

334
00:20:59,250 --> 00:21:00,250
I promise.

335
00:21:12,458 --> 00:21:13,458
Zhiqin.

336
00:21:14,375 --> 00:21:15,583
If Lu Tao stays,

337
00:21:16,250 --> 00:21:17,570
you have to leave no matter what.

338
00:21:19,208 --> 00:21:20,291
Xiaofan, trust me.

339
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:22,666
Bei Lüqing isn't that powerful.

340
00:21:23,833 --> 00:21:24,833
Actually,

341
00:21:25,500 --> 00:21:27,583
Even if we pull this off,

342
00:21:28,625 --> 00:21:30,425
it won't shake my
brother at his foundations.

343
00:21:31,791 --> 00:21:33,458
Then what did you do all this for?

344
00:21:34,333 --> 00:21:35,813
You're not even making money from it.

345
00:21:37,625 --> 00:21:40,291
But it will definitely hit him hard.

346
00:21:41,374 --> 00:21:43,415
He's never tasted failure in his entire life.

347
00:21:44,375 --> 00:21:45,500
This loss

348
00:21:46,791 --> 00:21:48,375
will stay with him forever.

349
00:21:50,500 --> 00:21:51,125
So you did this to...
I don't know either.

350
00:21:53,791 --> 00:21:57,416
Maybe... I just wanted him to remember me.

351
00:22:01,125 --> 00:22:02,666
I don't expect

352
00:22:03,416 --> 00:22:04,500
much of a future with him.

353
00:22:05,791 --> 00:22:06,791
All I want is for him

354
00:22:08,291 --> 00:22:09,875
to carry my memory forever,

355
00:22:12,041 --> 00:22:13,625
even if all he feels is hate.

356
00:22:36,833 --> 00:22:37,833
Lüqing.

357
00:22:38,291 --> 00:22:39,624
Isn't this too risky?

358
00:22:39,625 --> 00:22:41,458
After all, Li Wenxi's no small player.

359
00:22:42,375 --> 00:22:44,583
You talked me into this market,

360
00:22:45,625 --> 00:22:47,500
yet you're bailing out now?

361
00:22:48,083 --> 00:22:48,875
Lüqing.

362
00:22:48,876 --> 00:22:50,499
You've never been such a risk-taker.

363
00:22:50,500 --> 00:22:51,500
What's really going on?

364
00:22:57,250 --> 00:22:59,666
Lu Xiaofan is dead set
on divorcing Bei Lüxin.

365
00:23:00,833 --> 00:23:02,125
That's completely unrelated.

366
00:23:04,083 --> 00:23:05,375
I'm going to marry Lu Xiaofan.

367
00:23:07,500 --> 00:23:08,291
Bei Lüqing.

368
00:23:08,416 --> 00:23:09,416
Have you lost your mind?

369
00:23:09,791 --> 00:23:11,208
Your parents are going to...

370
00:23:11,708 --> 00:23:13,666
This is the only way I'll have leverage

371
00:23:13,875 --> 00:23:15,625
to properly protect Lu Xiaofan.

372
00:23:29,041 --> 00:23:30,208
I can't really explain this.

373
00:23:30,541 --> 00:23:32,021
So I sent them to see for themselves.

374
00:23:40,500 --> 00:23:41,500
Ah?

375
00:23:42,916 --> 00:23:43,956
Why are potatoes going up?

376
00:23:46,958 --> 00:23:47,958
It's Lu Xiaofan.

377
00:23:48,708 --> 00:23:50,249
Flight YG1213

378
00:23:50,250 --> 00:23:51,707
to Porto,

379
00:23:51,708 --> 00:23:52,708
attention.

380
00:23:52,750 --> 00:23:53,750
Your flight...

381
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:55,582
Lu Xiaofan doesn't believe for a second

382
00:23:55,583 --> 00:23:58,166
he can take down Bei Lüqing in one blow.

383
00:23:58,500 --> 00:24:00,916
He's less optimistic than
Lu Tao and Shen Zhiqin.

384
00:24:01,166 --> 00:24:03,457
He is almost constantly on the move,

385
00:24:03,458 --> 00:24:04,458
desperate to get away.

386
00:24:04,583 --> 00:24:07,000
And he knows he'll never come back.

387
00:24:07,708 --> 00:24:09,125
Without Bei Lüqing,

388
00:24:09,416 --> 00:24:10,915
Lu Xiaofan would just be

389
00:24:10,916 --> 00:24:12,958
a regular farmer like his dad.

390
00:24:13,041 --> 00:24:14,083
Not all good,

391
00:24:14,333 --> 00:24:15,458
not all bad.

392
00:24:16,291 --> 00:24:17,915
He would've married a thrifty,

393
00:24:17,916 --> 00:24:19,583
feisty woman like his mother,

394
00:24:20,041 --> 00:24:21,415
had one child,

395
00:24:21,416 --> 00:24:22,750
then two extra kids.

396
00:24:23,083 --> 00:24:25,041
And lived poor yet lively.

397
00:24:25,666 --> 00:24:28,000
Lu Xiaofan doesn't hate that he's abnormal.

398
00:24:28,125 --> 00:24:29,207
Yet he hates

399
00:24:29,208 --> 00:24:30,665
being different,

400
00:24:30,666 --> 00:24:31,958
and he's alone.

401
00:24:32,083 --> 00:24:33,416
He won't hate his mother,

402
00:24:33,916 --> 00:24:35,833
barely hates Lu Xiaoping,

403
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:37,833
and never Bei Lüxin.

404
00:24:38,125 --> 00:24:41,000
But he has to hate the man
who repeatedly gave him dreams,

405
00:24:41,166 --> 00:24:43,583
only to snatch them all away.

406
00:24:43,833 --> 00:24:45,041
When he thinks of him...

407
00:24:45,541 --> 00:24:46,901
Just thinking of him stirs hatred.

408
00:24:47,416 --> 00:24:48,916
It makes his legs tremble.

409
00:24:49,250 --> 00:24:50,250
Thinking of him...

410
00:24:51,375 --> 00:24:53,291
He cannot stop thinking about him.

411
00:24:53,875 --> 00:24:55,958
He wants him to never forget him.

412
00:25:38,791 --> 00:25:39,583
Hello?
Who is this?

413
00:25:42,666 --> 00:25:43,750
No words? I'll hang up.

414
00:25:44,541 --> 00:25:46,083
Zhiqin, it's me.

415
00:25:48,250 --> 00:25:49,791
It's me, Lu Xiaofan.

416
00:25:50,416 --> 00:25:51,416
You...

417
00:26:13,764 --> 00:26:16,558
[Bank transfer to Shen Zhiqin]

418
00:26:26,583 --> 00:26:27,375
Mr. Lu Tao,

419
00:26:27,458 --> 00:26:28,707
you are under formal arrest

420
00:26:28,708 --> 00:26:29,791
for market-manipulation.

421
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:31,125
Please come with us.

422
00:26:37,208 --> 00:26:38,875
I did all of this on my own.

423
00:26:39,500 --> 00:26:40,958
No one else was involved.

424
00:26:50,899 --> 00:26:53,253
Following a court trial, Lu Tao was sentenced
to 5 years in prison for market-manipulation.

425
00:26:53,291 --> 00:26:55,599
Bei Lüqing was also investigates for the
same case and had all his gans confiscated.

426
00:27:09,958 --> 00:27:11,166
What can I get for you?

427
00:27:12,125 --> 00:27:13,957
I will have one bone soup

428
00:27:13,958 --> 00:27:15,916
and one seafood porridge.

429
00:27:16,666 --> 00:27:17,666
Sure.

430
00:27:18,416 --> 00:27:19,416
No scallions.

431
00:27:20,250 --> 00:27:21,708
Would you like some celery then?

432
00:27:37,083 --> 00:27:38,666
Tell me, are you really that stupid?

433
00:27:39,125 --> 00:27:41,392
You wired money to Shen Zhiqin
from your Portuguese account.

434
00:27:41,416 --> 00:27:43,583
You're basically telling
us exactly where you are.

435
00:27:43,791 --> 00:27:45,031
So what's the point of running?

436
00:27:48,333 --> 00:27:49,500
He started it.

437
00:27:52,916 --> 00:27:55,666
You've got quite a memorable method for me.

438
00:27:58,583 --> 00:27:59,375
Hey, Lüqing.

439
00:27:59,416 --> 00:28:00,666
No more talking to him.

440
00:28:00,791 --> 00:28:01,875
Just finish him off.

441
00:28:04,875 --> 00:28:06,115
Where are my soup and porridge?

442
00:28:10,833 --> 00:28:12,666
Bro... the porridge...

443
00:28:22,250 --> 00:28:23,416
Well now, Lu Xiaofan.

444
00:28:23,875 --> 00:28:25,665
First you nearly bankrupted us

445
00:28:25,666 --> 00:28:26,786
and scared us half to death.

446
00:28:27,041 --> 00:28:29,208
Then you wore us out
searching everywhere for you.

447
00:28:29,250 --> 00:28:30,915
And now you're going around
calling everyone “brother,”

448
00:28:30,916 --> 00:28:31,916
acting all chummy.

449
00:28:32,541 --> 00:28:34,208
But have you ever thought

450
00:28:34,750 --> 00:28:36,190
with all the people you've offended,

451
00:28:36,458 --> 00:28:37,875
with this huge mess you've created,

452
00:28:39,500 --> 00:28:42,000
what's become of your Lu family now?

453
00:28:44,333 --> 00:28:45,333
Bro.

454
00:28:45,958 --> 00:28:47,541
Is what Ziyang was saying true?

455
00:28:50,166 --> 00:28:51,582
Your bro isn't pursuing this,

456
00:28:51,583 --> 00:28:53,500
but that doesn't mean the rest of us...

457
00:29:00,375 --> 00:29:02,184
A man must take
responsibility for his own actions.

458
00:29:02,208 --> 00:29:03,874
I'll answer for the trouble I've caused.

459
00:29:03,875 --> 00:29:05,291
Lu Xiaofan, calm down!

460
00:29:18,416 --> 00:29:19,708
Let's get married.

461
00:29:24,708 --> 00:29:26,458
You really are going to be the death of me.

462
00:29:26,625 --> 00:29:28,309
We were just teasing,
but you took it seriously.

463
00:29:28,333 --> 00:29:29,999
If we were really here for revenge,

464
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:31,684
why would we be wasting
our time here with you?

465
00:29:31,708 --> 00:29:32,708
Honestly...

466
00:29:35,833 --> 00:29:36,833
Bro.

467
00:29:38,041 --> 00:29:39,041
You...

468
00:29:39,541 --> 00:29:41,791
Weren't you getting engaged?

469
00:29:42,333 --> 00:29:44,813
If Lüqing hadn't been trying to
earn enough money to get away,

470
00:29:45,083 --> 00:29:47,332
why else would he have
agreed to trade futures?

471
00:29:47,333 --> 00:29:48,749
He was just polite to
that woman for a few days

472
00:29:48,750 --> 00:29:50,291
to fool his mom and Li Wenxi.

473
00:29:50,732 --> 00:29:52,012
And you threw quite the tantrum.

474
00:29:52,583 --> 00:29:55,166
You nearly made us
tag-alongs lose our shirts.

475
00:29:55,583 --> 00:29:56,624
Even my old man's secret stash

476
00:29:56,625 --> 00:29:58,065
almost got wiped out because of you.

477
00:29:58,875 --> 00:30:00,458
If you hadn't run off so fast,

478
00:30:00,583 --> 00:30:01,958
you'd be dead meat.

479
00:30:18,750 --> 00:30:19,875
Your cooking hasn't changed.

480
00:30:22,458 --> 00:30:26,166
From now on, you'll make me
porridge for the rest of my life.

481
00:30:29,041 --> 00:30:30,166
Are you willing?

482
00:30:42,083 --> 00:30:43,166
I am.

483
00:31:05,166 --> 00:31:06,166
Let's go.

484
00:31:51,666 --> 00:31:52,666
Bei Lüqing.

485
00:31:52,666 --> 00:31:55,333
Do you take Lu Xiaofan
to be your partner?

486
00:31:55,750 --> 00:31:59,832
In the presence of God,
to love and cherish him from this day forward,

487
00:31:59,926 --> 00:32:01,540
and to take care of him,

488
00:32:02,020 --> 00:32:05,380
to respect him in health and sickness,

489
00:32:05,593 --> 00:32:08,313
to respect until the end of your life?

490
00:32:11,250 --> 00:32:12,500
I will.

491
00:32:13,500 --> 00:32:14,625
Lu Xiaofan.

492
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:17,241
Will you take
Bei Lüqing as your partner?

493
00:32:17,493 --> 00:32:20,743
In the presence of God,
to love and cherish him

494
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:23,125
in health and sickness, to respect...

495
00:32:23,126 --> 00:32:24,333
I will.

496
00:32:26,625 --> 00:32:29,583
Congratulations. You two may kiss each other.

497
00:33:07,625 --> 00:33:08,625
Lu Xiaofan.

498
00:33:09,458 --> 00:33:10,458
I just realized

499
00:33:11,958 --> 00:33:14,478
this might be the first time
I've ever looked at you like this.

500
00:33:45,833 --> 00:33:46,833
Bro.

501
00:34:04,125 --> 00:34:06,000
Why are you up before
the alarm even went off?

502
00:34:08,708 --> 00:34:09,708
Bro.

503
00:34:09,916 --> 00:34:13,125
You need to strip the
tough fibers off the celery,

504
00:34:13,333 --> 00:34:14,958
otherwise it'll get stuck in your teeth.

505
00:34:22,666 --> 00:34:23,666
Like this.

506
00:34:25,250 --> 00:34:26,250
Then you do it.

507
00:34:37,541 --> 00:34:38,541
Oh, by the way, bro.

508
00:34:38,916 --> 00:34:40,996
You need to boil the
water first, then add the rice.

509
00:34:41,083 --> 00:34:42,403
Otherwise it'll stick to the pot.

510
00:34:47,166 --> 00:34:50,000
And the rice needs to
be soaked in advance too.

511
00:34:52,541 --> 00:34:54,291
So it cooks softer and more tender.

512
00:34:57,666 --> 00:35:00,750
Looks like I'll have to
work a little harder then.

513
00:35:01,208 --> 00:35:03,458
From now on, just tell
me what you want to eat.

514
00:35:03,958 --> 00:35:04,958
I'll make it.

515
00:35:09,750 --> 00:35:11,666
If I'd worked a little harder last night,

516
00:35:13,041 --> 00:35:14,666
you wouldn't have so much to say today.

517
00:35:23,916 --> 00:35:25,666
This New Year, let's go to France.

518
00:35:26,333 --> 00:35:28,625
To see the Eiffel Tower
you've been dreaming about.

519
00:35:32,541 --> 00:35:33,541
Bro.

520
00:35:33,875 --> 00:35:35,083
I need to tell you something.

521
00:35:35,708 --> 00:35:36,833
Don't get mad.

522
00:35:37,583 --> 00:35:38,583
Okay.

523
00:35:39,541 --> 00:35:41,000
My mom said

524
00:35:41,416 --> 00:35:45,000
she wants us both to
come home this New Year.

525
00:36:05,250 --> 00:36:06,541
My mom said

526
00:36:08,791 --> 00:36:11,458
a new couple must pay respects
to the ancestors together,

527
00:36:12,041 --> 00:36:13,583
only then are you truly recognized.

528
00:36:20,250 --> 00:36:21,250
Okay.
